Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}俺のターン　ドロー！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}俺は　ブリキンギョを召喚！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　铁皮金鱼！
